coding (dflash) tokens/step is a function of prompt style: random-token benchmark corpora collapse acceptance; measured random-prompt numbers CANNOT judge spec-decode levers. (9) Random-token Magpie corpus IS valid for GEMM/config/graph levers. (10) One MI250X die == one MI210 (gfx90a/104CU/64GiB): INT8 W8A8 27B single-die BF16-out serving hits ~80 tok/s single-stream WITH dflash on natural prose, ~50-65 without; TP=1 preferred for 27B-class weights (no cross-die comm).\"\n}\n=== MANIFEST ===\n{\n  \"claw_session_id\": null,\n  \"code_revision\": \"\",\n  \"created_at_utc\": \"2026-09-14T13:49:02+00:00\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"inferencex\": {\n      \"commit\": \"3d55815\",\n      \"path\": \"/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/.cache/InferenceX@3d5581562f643f9bdeb8410cd924e2c70906c966\",\n      \"remote\": \"https://github.com/SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX.git\"\n    },\n    \"magpie\": {\n      \"commit\": \"\",\n      \"path\": \"/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages\",\n      \"remote\": \"\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"ep\": 1,\n  \"framework\": \"vllm\",\n  \"gfx_arch\": \"gfx90a\",\n  \"gpu_specialist_capacity\": 2,\n  \"gpu_type\": \"\",\n  \"graph_mode\": null,\n  \"host\": \"amd-server\",\n  \"image\": \"rocm-ai/vllm:0.28.0-rocm7.2.4\",\n  \"kb_degraded_reason\": null,\n  \"max_minutes\": 180,\n  \"model_name\": \"Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-W8A8-gdnint8\",\n  \"model_path\": \"/mnt/stripe-3mix-3t2/models/davetha/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-W8A8-gdnint8\",\n  \"objective\": {\n    \"kind\": \"gain_pct\",\n    \"value\": 30.0\n  },\n  \"pid\": 7219,\n  \"pr_degraded_reason\": \"ir3_auto\",\n  \"reference_script\": null,\n  \"research_lane_capacity\": 4,\n  \"sandbox_user_id\": null,\n  \"schema_version\": 4,\n  \"server_args\": [\n    \"--trust-remote-code\",\n    \"--language-model-only\",\n    \"--quantization\",\n    \"compressed-tensors\",\n    \"--safetensors-load-strategy\",\n    \"eager\",\n    \"--compilation-config\",\n    \"{\\\"cudagraph_mode\\\":\\\"FULL_DECOD